---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout hideHeader locale="en" pageKey="cookies" title="Cookie Settings - Supadio Guide" description="Manage essential, analytics, preference, and marketing cookies for Supadio Guide.">
  <main class="min-h-screen bg-cloud pb-20 pt-12"><div class="container-site max-w-4xl">
    <a href="/en/" class="text-sm font-bold text-river underline">← Back to Supadio Guide</a>
    <header class="mt-12 border-b border-ink/10 pb-10"><p class="eyebrow text-river">Privacy controls</p><h1 class="mt-4 text-5xl font-black tracking-[-.04em]">Cookie Settings</h1><p class="mt-4 text-ink/55">Last updated: August 2026</p><p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl leading-7 text-ink/70">You can change these choices at any time. Disabling analytics does not block access to the main information on the site.</p></header>
    <form id="cookie-settings" class="mt-10 space-y-4">
      <div class="card flex items-start justify-between gap-6 p-6"><div><h2 class="text-xl font-extrabold">Necessary cookies</h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-ink/65">Required for core site functions and for storing consent choices in the browser.</p></div><label class="shrink-0 text-sm font-bold"><input type="checkbox" checked disabled /> Always active</label></div>
      <div class="card flex items-start justify-between gap-6 p-6"><div><h2 class="text-xl font-extrabold">Analytics cookies</h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-ink/65">Google Analytics 4 helps us understand site usage in aggregate. It is loaded only after you approve this category.</p></div><label class="shrink-0 text-sm font-bold"><input id="analytics" type="checkbox" /> Enable</label></div>
      <div class="card flex items-start justify-between gap-6 p-6"><div><h2 class="text-xl font-extrabold">Preference cookies</h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-ink/65">These may be used to remember interface preferences such as your chosen language and similar presentation settings.</p></div><label class="shrink-0 text-sm font-bold"><input id="preferences" type="checkbox" /> Enable</label></div>
      <div class="card flex items-start justify-between gap-6 p-6"><div><h2 class="text-xl font-extrabold">Marketing cookies</h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-ink/65">Supadio Guide does not run personalised advertising and does not enable marketing cookies.</p></div><label class="shrink-0 text-sm font-bold"><input type="checkbox" disabled /> Disabled</label></div>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 pt-4"><button type="submit" class="rounded-full bg-river px-6 py-3 font-extrabold text-white">Save preferences</button><button id="reject-all" type="button" class="rounded-full border border-ink/20 px-6 py-3 font-extrabold">Reject all optional</button></div>
      <p id="cookie-status" class="text-sm font-bold text-river" aria-live="polite"></p>
    </form>
    <section class="prose-legal"><h2>Managing consent</h2><p>Preferences are stored in browser local storage. Removing site data from the browser may erase these choices and cause the consent banner to appear again.</p><h2>Third-party services</h2><p>Google Maps is embedded on the homepage to show location context. Loading the map may trigger technical processing by Google separately from the Google Analytics choice. If you prefer not to interact with the map, you can still use the text address and coordinates on the homepage.</p></section>
  </div></main>
  <script is:inline>
    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
      const form = document.getElementById('cookie-settings');
      const analytics = document.getElementById('analytics');
      const preferences = document.getElementById('preferences');
      const status = document.getElementById('cookie-status');
      const api = window.SupadioConsent;
      const current = api?.read?.();
      if (current) { analytics.checked = !!current.analytics; preferences.checked = !!current.preferences; }
      form?.addEventListener('submit', (e) => { e.preventDefault(); api?.save?.({ analytics: analytics.checked, preferences: preferences.checked }); status.textContent = 'Preferences saved.'; });
      document.getElementById('reject-all')?.addEventListener('click', () => { analytics.checked = false; preferences.checked = false; api?.save?.({ analytics: false, preferences: false }); status.textContent = 'All optional categories were disabled.'; });
    });
  </script>
</BaseLayout>
